<title>USA: Omaha hogs off $0.25-0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs off $0.25-0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $0.25 to $0.50 lower. Top $49.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    230-250 lbs opened 49.00</p>
<p>Sows - not established.</p>
</text>
